# Frontend

- **Vite + React + TypeScript**. Keep UI thin and functional — no design system chase.
- Wire to backend `/api/v1`. Configure API base URL via env (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`).
- Required flows: upload PDF → show/edit draft → **Confirm** to save; Order list; edit/delete with **confirm dialogs** (no silent saves).
- Do not call Gemini from the browser. Do not store secrets in the frontend.
- CORS is a backend concern; frontend must use the deployed API origin in production.
- Official ref: https://vitejs.dev/guide/
